  "prefLabel": "Fis 403.14 River Herring",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 403.14 River Herring. The Merrimack River and tributaries shall be closed to the taking of alewife (Alosa pseudoharengus) and blueback herring (Alosa aestivalis).\n\nSource. #10936, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14173, eff 1-9-25, EXPIRES: 1-9-35; ss by #14418, eff 10-22-25, EXPIRES: 10-22-35 (formerly Fis 403.13)",
